Pearson documents a lot, so when L’Enfant Plaza became a common place for voice insertion, he wrote about that too.

“(Jared) is a snake” — Jared is a attorney acquaintance of Pearson who hadn’t even had the man on his mind when it happened.
“Tactical Strategy” followed by “The US has started something it cannot finish” — Pearson was at L’Enfant Plaza to grab a quick bite. His apartment is not too far. For $5 or so, he got a small side entree, then he sat in the food court. This was the week of September 27. “Stratégie tactique” or tactical strategy. “I am practicing my French. It came through in French! I don’t know if that was intended, though I noted that these assailants switched languages soon after I started studying.” Pearson says that he looked around. The only person in close proximity was a man. Pearson doesn’t want to get into calling out race or ethnicity, but the man was a racial minority. “I don’t want to blame him when I was in a food court with a bunch of people.” Pearson doesn’t know what could have been the technological source, but he had a recent experience that raises a question of brain-to-brain transmission. “If you’re used as a ‘tower’, I don’t believe that you know you’re transmitting. Pearson recently wrote about a suspected case involving the maintenance man at his building. The account gets more disturbing at L’Enfant Plaz. Pearson walks outside, taking a hallway immediately on his left. “The US has started something that it cannot finish.” Pearson is having none of it. “Leave me the hell alone!” Pearson feels that his account of torture in the US amounts to modern-slavery. He is absolutely not going to be pulled in anything beyond his account of torture. He is not even willing to speculate in writing what it could have meant, assuming it wasn’t a ruse. “These assailants have falsely said I was an alien, a government special agent, a veteran, Christ, a Russian target, possessing super powers, a pedophile…you name it. They have claimed ‘God is in control,’ then switched it up months later to ‘We’re in control’. Which is it? I refuse to speculate publicly. It’s an exercise in futility.”
“On Entend

Pearson also had a voice insertion at the market on October 3. He noted the time around 3:14pm. Pearson was taking a break in the alley. “On entend.” It translates as “We’re listening” or “People are listening” in English. Pearson says that it could have been “on attend” — “We are waiting” or “People are waiting.” They sound similar. “Look, it doesn’t really matter. Stop it. What’s wrong with these people?! I have no idea what technology they are using. The case for transmission via the chip was that Pearson’s direct line of sight was this side of the buildings — he was in a narrow alley with not view of much. He has established the the clicks in his head with the chip corresponded to Bluetooth on public infrastructure. “Those antennas on the top could be the source. I was next to a store. They could have something. There was a woman taking out of the trash right behind me — something on her person or being used as a ‘tower’. It could also be in the air somewhere. Who the hell knows.”

Prefabricated Homes

In mid-to-late September, Pearson was walking back home late from the forest. It was past 2am. As he crossed the National Mall from around 7th, he noticed some homes that they had temporarily built — something of an annual thing. Then a voice, “Prefabricated homes.” Pearson doesn’t think this is the campaign. “I think the people who put up these homes have this voice insertion technology for passersby. What the hell is wrong with them?! Put up a sign and get out of people’s heads.” Pearson knows that technology for ultrasonic voice violence is used in museums. “It still doesn’t make it ok. Hello! Cognitive liberty. Civil liberties.” Pearson is on to something — US normalization of voice inserted violence — the public and private sectors. “It been weaponized, ok?! What the hell are people thinking? No wonder it seems like many people seem to be losing their grip on reality — playing God and the devil en même temps.”


